.TH PROXMOX-BIOME 1
.SH NAME
proxmox-biome \- Wrapper around biome to use the profile matching the Proxmox Javascript Style guide as close as possible.
.SH DESCRIPTION
This tool acts like biome, accepting all of its available arguments, but defaults to a biome.json profile that comes with it.
The biome.json profile can be found under:
.nf
\fI/usr/share/proxmox-biome/biome.json\fR
.fi
.SH SYNOPSIS
proxmox-biome [OPTIONS] FILE...
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR biome --help,
